  user preamble: demonstrated answer is first-mentioned in 400/800 demo turns (50%)
  position is counterbalanced within each preamble
  preamble uses 6 distinct instruction frames across 8 demo turns
  dev-single-desired-all.jsonl: 6 final frames, each order-balanced
  dev-single-undesired-all.jsonl: 6 final frames, each order-balanced
